# Tropical Shopify Theme

## Architecture

- Online Store 2.0: JSON templates in `templates/`, sections in `sections/`, partials in `snippets/`
- Each homepage module is a section with its own `{% schema %}`, styles, and markup
- Use BEM class naming: `.block`, `.block__element`, `.block--modifier`

## HTML

- One element per line (opening tag, content, closing tag each on their own line)
- Use semantic HTML (`section`, `nav`, `article`, etc.)
- Include accessible labels, alt text, and skip links where relevant

## Liquid

- Prefer `{% render 'snippet' %}` over `{% include %}`
- Section settings via `section.settings.*`; blocks via `block.settings.*`
- Keep business logic minimal — presentation belongs in Liquid, data comes from Shopify (or mocks locally)

## CSS

- Scoped styles in `{% stylesheet %}` blocks within sections when possible
- Global tokens and resets live in `assets/base.css`
- Use CSS custom properties from theme settings where applicable
- Layout: `--content-width` (1440px), `--content-width-max` (1680px), `--content-padding-x` (20px)
- Wrap section content in `.container` (standard) or `.container.container--max` (wide)
- Typography: `font_picker` settings + `snippets/fonts.liquid` (`font_face`, `font_modify`, `preload_tag`)
- Body font: Roboto (`--font-body-family`); headings: Josefin Sans (`--font-heading-family`)
- Colors: `--color-text` (#000), `--color-primary` (#a5171f), `--color-background` / `--color-white` (#fff)
- Radius: `--card-radius`, `--button-radius`, and `--input-radius` scale up at 768px and 1024px breakpoints

## Local preview

- Run `npm run dev` to preview without a Shopify account
- Test sections in isolation at `/sections/{name}`
- Update mock data in `dev/mocks/` for local testing
